get.description:
根据产品ID查询审批流程。
1. 查询产品关联的审批流程时,可以通过need_detail参数控制是否查询审批流程详情
接口请求示例如下:
rest/product/v3.0/{product_id}/approval?need_detail=true
接口响应如下:
{
    "total": 2,
    "approvalList": [
        {
            "action": "apply",
            "action_Name": "{\"zh_CN\":\"申请\",\"en_US\":\"Request\"}",
            "process_id": "审批流程id",
            "process_details": "{\"create_time\":\"2022-07-29 09:18:36\",\"level\":1,\"user_name\":\"bss_admin\",\"description\":\"aa\",\"process_step_users\":[{\"vdc_name\":\"operationadministrator\",\"process_step_id\":\"审批流程id\",\"step_users_name\":\"bss_admin\",\"step_id\":1,\"vdc_id\":\"0\"}],\"vdc_id\":\"0\",\"update_time\":\"2022-09-22 14:13:56\",\"user_id\":\"5836a76e6c15442da853726a2476763b\",\"name\":\"testLevel\",\"process_type\":\"system\",\"id\":\"d6037d92-0a24-4564-9a5b-63641e98accc\",\"status\":\"published\"}"
        },
        {
            "action": "clone",
            "action_Name": "{\"zh_CN\":\"克隆\",\"en_US\":\"Clone\"}",
            "process_id": "审批流程id",
            "process_details": "{\"create_time\":\"2022-07-29 09:18:36\",\"level\":1,\"user_name\":\"bss_admin\",\"description\":\"aa\",\"process_step_users\":[{\"vdc_name\":\"operationadministrator\",\"process_step_id\":\"b0890b10-e1d4-49ca-a058-4299257393e6\",\"step_users_name\":\"bss_admin\",\"step_id\":1,\"vdc_id\":\"0\"}],\"vdc_id\":\"0\",\"update_time\":\"2022-09-22 14:13:56\",\"user_id\":\"5836a76e6c15442da853726a2476763b\",\"name\":\"testLevel\",\"process_type\":\"system\",\"id\":\"d6037d92-0a24-4564-9a5b-63641e98accc\",\"status\":\"published\"}"
        }
    ],
    "version": null
}
如果need_detail=false,则接口响应中的process_details参数就返回null

2. 查询产品某个审批项关联的审批流程,通过action参数查询
接口请求示例如下:
rest/product/v3.0/{product_id}/approval?need_detail=true&action=apply
接口响应示例如下:
{
    "total": 1,
    "approvalList": [
        {
            "action": "apply",
            "action_Name": "{\"zh_CN\":\"申请\",\"en_US\":\"Request\"}",
            "process_id": "审批流程id",
            "process_details": "{\"create_time\":\"2022-07-29 09:18:36\",\"level\":1,\"user_name\":\"bss_admin\",\"description\":\"aa\",\"process_step_users\":[{\"vdc_name\":\"operationadministrator\",\"process_step_id\":\"b0890b10-e1d4-49ca-a058-4299257393e6\",\"step_users_name\":\"bss_admin\",\"step_id\":1,\"vdc_id\":\"0\"}],\"vdc_id\":\"0\",\"update_time\":\"2022-09-22 14:13:56\",\"user_id\":\"5836a76e6c15442da853726a2476763b\",\"name\":\"testLevel\",\"process_type\":\"system\",\"id\":\"d6037d92-0a24-4564-9a5b-63641e98accc\",\"status\":\"published\"}"
        }
    ],
    "version": null
}

3. 查询产品发布阶段或上线阶段关联的审批流程,通过history参数查询
接口请求示例如下:
rest/product/v3.0/{product_id}/approval?need_detail=true&history=online
接口响应示例如下:
